WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.912 --> 00:00:06.032
Let's do a lesson. After you sign in, you'll see your classroom home page.

2
00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:14.624
Your teacher's assignments are here, as cards. Lessons are on top, and brain games are below. Select a lesson to begin.

3
00:00:15.126 --> 00:00:27.376
A lesson has steps. You might read a handout, watch a video, and write a short reflection before you start, to share what you already think. Type your answer, and select Save Response.

4
00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:39.098
Then there's a quiz. Choose an answer for each question. You can select Save Progress, and come back later. But you only get one try when you submit, so take your time.

5
00:00:39.599 --> 00:00:44.319
When you're sure, select Submit Quiz. You'll see which answers were right.

6
00:00:44.821 --> 00:00:55.001
After the quiz, write another short reflection. Keep your writing kind and appropriate. Some messages can't be saved, and you'll see a note if that happens.

7
00:00:55.503 --> 00:00:59.923
You can set a goal for yourself. Type it, and select Save Goal.

8
00:01:00.425 --> 00:01:05.995
When you've finished everything, select Mark as Complete. Your teacher will see that you finished.

9
00:01:06.498 --> 00:01:11.908
To play a brain game, go back to your home page and select it. It opens right there.

10
00:01:12.411 --> 00:01:20.411
Play through the game. When you finish, your score is saved. Some older games ask you to select Mark as Done when you're finished.
